ent-ClothingOuterSuitBomb = 防爆服 | bomb suit
    .desc = 一種專為抵禦炸彈產生的壓力及炸彈可能產生的任何碎片而設計的重型防護服。 | A heavy suit designed to withstand the pressure generated by a bomb and any fragments the bomb may produce.
ent-ClothingOuterSuitJanitorBomb = 清潔工用防爆服 | janitorial bomb suit
    .desc = 專為抵禦由化學物質反應所引發的爆炸而設計的重型防彈衣。 | Heavy body armor designed to withstand explosions formed from reactions between chemicals.
ent-ClothingOuterSuitFire = 防火服 | fire suit
    .desc = 一套有助於抵禦極端溫度危害的防護服。 | A suit that helps protect against hazardous temperatures.
ent-ClothingOuterSuitAtmosFire = atmos 防火服 | atmos fire suit
    .desc = 一款價格不菲的防火服，即使面對最致命的消防站火災也能提供防護。其設計即使穿著者被火焰籠罩，仍能提供保護。 | An expensive firesuit that protects against even the most deadly of station fires. Designed to protect even if the wearer is set aflame.
ent-ClothingOuterSuitRad = 防輻射服 | radiation suit
    .desc = 一套能防輻射的防護服。標籤上寫著：「含鉛成分。請勿吞食隔熱材料。」 | A suit that protects against radiation. The label reads, 'Made with lead. Please do not consume insulation.'
ent-ClothingOuterSuitSpaceNinja = 太空忍者服 | space ninja suit
    .desc = 這套黑色、技術先進且經控制論增強的戰甲，具備諸如隱形或瞬間移動等多種能力。 | This black technologically advanced, cybernetically-enhanced suit provides many abilities like invisibility or teleportation.
ent-ClothingOuterSuitChicken = 雞裝 | chicken suit
    .desc = 咯咯咯！ | Bok bok bok!
ent-ClothingOuterSuitShrineMaiden = 神女服裝 | shrine maiden outfit
    .desc = 真讓人想去對付幾隻麻煩的妖怪啊。 | Makes you want to go deal with some troublesome youkai.
ent-ClothingOuterSuitWitchRobes = 女巫長袍 | witch robes
    .desc = 魔法的關鍵就在於法術威力，ZE！ | Magic is all about the spell power, ZE!
ent-ClothingOuterSuitMonkey = 猴子裝 | monkey suit
    .desc = 一套看起來像靈長類動物的西裝。 | A suit that looks like a primate.
ent-ClothingOuterSuitIan = 伊恩套裝 | ian suit
    .desc = 誰是個好孩子呢？ | Who's a good boy?
ent-ClothingOuterSuitCarp = 鯉魚套裝 | carp suit
    .desc = 一套特殊的服裝，如果你視力不佳的話，穿上它就會讓你看起來就像一條太空鯉魚。 | A special suit that makes you look just like a space carp, if your eyesight is bad.
ent-ClothingOuterHardsuitCarp = { ent-ClothingOuterSuitCarp }
    .desc = { ent-ClothingOuterSuitCarp.desc }
    .suffix = Hardsuit, DO NOT MAP
ent-ClothingOuterSuitTramDriver = 電車司機制服 | tram driver suit
    .desc = 它能讓你免受一切可能分散你注意力的事物干擾。也就是說，根本沒有任何干擾。 | It protects from everything that could distract you. That is, nothing at all.
